{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_title", "source_sha256": "ec83fc47bc828c2d84a0f8eabc33ca6dca2646331023247dd71bcdaf45a6eded", "ja": "やよいとおでかけ1", "zh": "和弥生出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5b9a6606f4c753fe6cdfe31c72b7791fb0c2df1552ab49c0da90a2b82d9c9377", "ja": "やよいとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和弥生一起外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e7b573a651562e132d4784aeeb107dcb29100d19f59fa16e73bb61b946cd1d3", "ja": "（やよいに、静岡名産のお茶のキャンペーンガールの\n仕事が来た。今日は、イベントで実演販売だ！）", "zh": "（弥生接到了静冈特产茶叶的宣传女孩工作。今天要在活动上进行现场销售！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "212bf673542d4489cb7af4105c0ff5fd241ffff93861700365634c3685b7b8a5", "ja": "やよい、今日は元気な売り子さんをして欲しいそうだ。\nちょっと練習してみるか？", "zh": "弥生，听说今天希望你能当个元气满满的推销员呢。\n要不要稍微练习一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "50b23dd1b4d9e32cb080b45e12c88f54d8e66bd0f83024b9f2e00a92a73cf155", "ja": "{$P$}、わかりました！\nそれじゃあ、いきますね！　えっと……。", "zh": "{$P$}，明白了！\n那么，我要开始了！那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "8ceb2def771d08a44a54e248324f23e6805ad8323b49ae9807bd3f7a9f2e51c3", "ja": "お茶ー！　おいしいお茶ですー！\nグイグイ飲めますよー！　いかがですかーっ！", "zh": "茶——！是好喝的茶哦——！\n可以咕嘟咕嘟地喝下去哦——！要来点吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aa946ecfdfc07873f667c218f0860ba5f2550b34b25c3956c0649922b80e91df", "ja": "うん、バッチリだな！\n本番もその調子で行こう！", "zh": "嗯，完美！\n正式演出也要保持这个状态继续加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "8a720a4aedcc2a1ca8e5eedc494af7c513923df9cd4e7fd4028e42f0fbc22295", "ja": "わかりました！　まかせてくださいー！\n……あ、そうだ。お仕事の前に……。", "zh": "明白了！交给我吧——！\n……啊，对了。在工作之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "f60e65f3ed45dd40b96bd94a84fad6273bf94ccfd8703e78311d5d49e9f03233", "ja": "私、お店の人に教わってお茶を淹れてみたんです！\n{$P$}、飲んでみてください！", "zh": "我向店里的人学了泡茶，试着泡了一壶！\n{$P$}，请您尝尝看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7a22fbc59bde38fb3044b7a5f023ba94347a6e2a1ebc826f3fd9f85dad1f5e7b", "ja": "やよいが淹れたお茶か、いただくよ。\n……うん、美味しいな！　ありがとう、やよい。", "zh": "这是弥生泡的茶吗？那我就喝了。\n……嗯，很好喝！谢谢你，弥生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "4e0a5b690c4beb3a73592128f28f836545a3d91021a510cb811b521b0495219c", "ja": "うっうー、本当ですか？　練習してよかったです！\n実演販売、がんばりますーっ！", "zh": "呜呜——真的吗？练习果然没白费！\n我会努力做好现场展示销售的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "680fa16c329b47cc22ded75735a7715afdfcfd2e9ac8975684f7ab35dd88e360", "ja": "（美味しいお茶をPRしつつ、静岡のみなさんに\nやよいをPRするぞ。気合いをいれていこう！）", "zh": "（一边宣传美味的茶，一边向静冈的各位宣传弥生。打起精神来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
